{"id":"98840b4d8c8dfdc2","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-blockerminors.md","title":"Blocker involution and deletion-contraction laws","display":"thm-blockerminors — Blocker involution and deletion-contraction laws","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-blockerminors","aliases":["27-thm-blockerminors"],"display":"thm-blockerminors — Blocker involution and deletion-contraction laws","depends_on":["[[27-df-sequentialtransversal]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_pdf_sha256":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f","source_section":"§4.2.3 Application 4.3","source_printed_pages":"179,180","source_pdf_pages":"203,204","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-blockerminors"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-blockerminors</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-blockerminors — Blocker involution and deletion-contraction laws"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"47c82d5007a17e60\" href=\"?note=47c82d5007a17e60\" title=\"27-df-sequentialtransversal\">27-df-sequentialtransversal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_pdf_sha256","html":"1f81062da95a70f9a4f89063cdedaaec08946ffbc117c7345baa7065770cfa1f"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.2.3 Application 4.3"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"179,180"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"203,204"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-and-proved-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> 为有限集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)\">\\(\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)\\)</span> 是 clutter，即不同成员互不包含；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq N\">\\(S\\subseteq N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq},\\mathrm{blk}\">\\(\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq},\\mathrm{blk}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"47c82d5007a17e60\" href=\"?note=47c82d5007a17e60\" title=\"27-df-sequentialtransversal\">27-df-sequentialtransversal</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"D_S(\\mathcal H)\\coloneqq\\{E\\in\\mathcal H\\mid E\\cap S=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad C_S(\\mathcal H)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq}\\{E\\setminus S\\mid E\\in\\mathcal H\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[D_S(\\mathcal H)\\coloneqq\\{E\\in\\mathcal H\\mid E\\cap S=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad C_S(\\mathcal H)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq}\\{E\\setminus S\\mid E\\in\\mathcal H\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\mathcal H))=\\mathcal H.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\mathcal H))=\\mathcal H.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{blk}_{N\\setminus S}(C_S(\\mathcal H))=D_S(\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\mathcal H)),\\qquad\\mathrm{blk}_{N\\setminus S}(D_S(\\mathcal H))=C_S(\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\mathcal H)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{blk}_{N\\setminus S}(C_S(\\mathcal H))=D_S(\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\mathcal H)),\\qquad\\mathrm{blk}_{N\\setminus S}(D_S(\\mathcal H))=C_S(\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\mathcal H)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>把 clutter 编码为正 DNF，其 blocker 是对偶函数的素项支持族。布尔对偶的对合律给出 blocker 对合；固定 x_i=1 对应缩约，固定 x_i=0 对应删除，而取对偶交换两种固定值，得到两条 minor 恒等式。来源原文给出这些对应，本页同时显式展开集合操作；不能把缩约后的非极小集合全部保留。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-sequentialtransversal","status":"resolved","id":"47c82d5007a17e60","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-sequentialtransversal]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-sequentialtransversal","status":"resolved","id":"47c82d5007a17e60","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$N$ 为有限集，$\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)$ 是 clutter，即不同成员互不包含；$S\\subseteq N$。$\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq},\\mathrm{blk}$ 见 [[27-df-sequentialtransversal]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal H\\subseteq\\mathcal P(N)","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq},\\mathrm{blk}","display":false},{"tex":"D_S(\\mathcal H)\\coloneqq\\{E\\in\\mathcal H\\mid E\\cap S=\\varnothing\\},\\qquad C_S(\\mathcal H)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Min}_{\\subseteq}\\{E\\setminus S\\mid E\\in\\mathcal H\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\mathcal H))=\\mathcal H.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{blk}_{N\\setminus S}(C_S(\\mathcal H))=D_S(\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\mathcal H)),\\qquad\\mathrm{blk}_{N\\setminus S}(D_S(\\mathcal H))=C_S(\\mathrm{blk}_N(\\mathcal H)).","display":true}],"bytes":1837,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-35","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-blockerminors|thm-blockerminors — Blocker involution and deletion-contraction laws]]"}],"outgoing":["47c82d5007a17e60"]}